# Stage 5 — Cholesky Ordering Sensitivity

This stage evaluates the sensitivity of the four-market FEVD results to alternative Cholesky orderings.

## File

`stage_5_cholesky_ordering_sensitivity.prg`

## Main Tasks

- Re-estimation of the four-variable VECM under alternative variable orderings
- Cholesky forecast-error variance decomposition
- Comparison of 12-month FEVDs across orderings

## Software

EViews
